    "Design ratio: L/G = 1.5 × 1.81 = 2.713 (rounds to 2.71).",
    "Liquid rate: L = 2.713 × 95 = 257.7 kmol/h.",
    "Solute absorbed = G(Y_in − Y_out) = 95 × 0.04757 = 4.519 kmol/h.",
    "Outlet liquid: X_out = 4.519/257.7 = 0.0175 kmol SO2/kmol water."
